  "content": "\n\n# 蘑菇岛维度\n\n蘑菇岛维度将蘑菇群系单一生物群系世界类型作为独立维度加入游戏。\n\n在此稀有生物群系中，每位玩家均可享有平等的空间，且不会限制探索。非常适合建造基地，因为此处不会生成怪物。\n\n![预览](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Y3EdVfom/images/15393a62596b6b7eee17e68b3c7593bb4d83b51d.jpeg)\n\n## 使用方法\n\n要进入蘑菇岛维度，请使用黑曜石搭建传送门框架，并在框架的两个上角放置菌丝块，两个下角放置粗泥，如下图所示：\n\n![蘑菇岛维度传送门](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ad6bcc4a76dbf416c94ba961b2caf2e567cef7da.png)\n\n## 兼容性\n\n- [Passengers Portal Fix](https://modrinth.com/project/LI0BrUQA)\n- **Create** 插件：[Create: Portal Integration](https://modrinth.com/project/2f4ngcAb)\n\n## 问题反馈\n\n目前暂无新的兼容性问题或漏洞报告。如有相关问题，请前往 [GitHub](https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-mushroomfieldsdimension/issues) 提交反馈，以便我们进行修复。\n\n## 支持情况\n\n🟩 26.1-26.1.2 / 🟩 1.21.1 / 🟥 1.21-1.21.11 / 🟩 1.20.1 / 🟪 1.16.5 / 🟪 1.12.2\n\n🟩 支持中  \n🟥 已停止支持  \n🟨 开发中  \n🟪 考虑支持中  \n\n## 说明\n\n欢迎在整合包、视频、直播或类似媒体内容中使用本模组。如果您喜欢这个模组，可以考虑提供资金支持，我将不胜感激。\n\n<br />\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/github-plural_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"See me on GitHub\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mahmudindes\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/available/curseforge_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Available on CurseForge\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@oreno69\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/youtube-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Watch me on YouTube\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/cuYgFmq3kz\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/discord-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Chat with me on Discord\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://patreon.com/mahmudindes\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/donate/patreon-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Support me on Patreon\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/oreno\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/donate/kofi-singular-alt_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Support me on Ko-fi\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://saweria.co/mahmudindes\"><img src=\"https://github.com/barraIhsan/devins-badges/blob/saweria/assets/compact-minimal/donate/saweria-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Support me on Saweria\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/dimensionfixer\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-dimensionfixer/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/dimensionfixer/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Dimension Fixer\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/dimensionlink\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-dimensionlink/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/dimensionlink/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Dimension Link\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/worldportal\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-worldportal/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/worldportal/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"World Portal\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/vanillaworld\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-vanillaworld/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/vanillaworld/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Vanilla World\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/morecatvariants\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-morecatvariants/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/morecatvariants/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"More Cat Variants\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/passengersportalfix\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-passengersportalfix/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/passengersportalfix/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Passengers Portal Fix\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/createportalintegration\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-createportalintegration/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/createportalintegration/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Create: Portal Integration\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/8SpfTsnq\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-superflatdimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/superflatdimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Superflat Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/y4wxFDPW\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-amplifieddimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/amplifieddimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Amplified Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/Fo9Xodfg\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-largebiomesdimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/largebiomesdimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Large Biomes Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/ItO3yfpJ\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-beta173dimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/beta173dimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Beta 1.7.3 Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/HkbFed4W\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-desertdimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/desertdimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Desert Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/HW5SOOxi\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-badlandsbiomesdimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/badlandsbiomesdimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Badlands Biomes Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/63pdCQ3Y\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-forestbiomesdimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/forestbiomesdimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Forest Biomes Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/SrhObyPX\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-thevoiddimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/thevoiddimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"The Void Dimension\"></a>\n</p>",
